(originals vs crops, aspect groups, the impossible-device file), then a NEW abstract namespace\n(`image.*`, `archive.*`, `log.*`/`event.*`, `disk.*`).\n\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\n# atlas rows\nrep(\"\"\"| 65 | MP4/MOV: ftyp major brand, mvhd creation_time (1904 epoch), duration, `©xyz` GPS, `©too` encoder | gap |\"\"\",\"\"\"| 65 | MP4/MOV: ftyp major brand, mvhd creation_time (1904 epoch), duration, `©xyz` GPS, `©too` encoder | partial (stream geometry seen D18 via media_video; atoms = gap mp4-mov-atoms) |\"\"\")\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')\ntail_tbl = \"\"\"| 106 | Disk images: VHD footer, VHDX, VMDK descriptor, QCOW2, ISO PVD | gap (disk-image-headers; ISO in archives-tar-7z-iso) | `conectix` / `vhdxfile` / `KDMV` / `QFI\\\\xfb` / `CD001` | struct; `qemu-img info` | low-med |\"\"\"\nnew_rows = tail_tbl + \"\"\"\n| 107 | `media.primary_video_dimensions` (ffprobe width x height of v:0) + codec/frame-rate/pix_fmt/profile/rotation siblings | seen D18 (`320x180`; prebuilt media_video.py under fmt `media`/`video`/`av`, ~100 fields) | `....ftyp` + `trak/mdia/hdlr` `vide`; stsd entry w,h u16 BE @+32; MKV PixelWidth; AVI strf | `lib.meta` (`media`, `primary_video_dimensions`); bundled `ffmpeg -hide_banner -i f` (I) prints `320x180 [SAR 1:1 DAR 16:9]` | high -- every timed kit from D19 |\n| 108 | Crop / aspect geometry: SAR (`pasp`/VUI), DAR, coded vs SPS-cropped size, tkhd display size, `clap`, QuickTime `tapt` clef/prof/enof, MKV PixelCrop*/DisplayWidth, rotated display dims | gap (video-geometry-crop-aspect) | flavor \"crops\"; stsd != tkhd/SPS; `pasp`/`clap`/`tapt` boxes; non-identity matrix | box walk + SPS frame_crop_* (`media_video._h264_sps` already parses SPS); ffmpeg -i shows SAR/DAR (I) | high -- D18 flavor |\n| 109 | Claimed device / provenance of a recording: mdta make/model/software, `©mak/©mod/©swr`, Android keys, handler_name, encoder, stsd compressorname, screen-recording markers | gap (video-device-provenance; atoms in mp4-mov-atoms) | `udta/meta/keys` `com.apple.quicktime.*`, `com.android.*`; `©too Lavf`; handler `Core Media Video` | box walk; ffmpeg -i prints tags (I); `exiftool -j -ee` (I) | high -- \"could not have come from the claimed device\" |\n| 110 | Stills as media streams: JPEG -> `mjpeg`, PNG -> `png`, GIF `gif`, BMP `bmp`, WebP `webp` (1 video stream, ffprobe dims) | gap (media-image-as-video-stream) -- lib answers `none` for jpg/png TODAY | `media.*video*` asked of a `.jpg/.png` \"preview\" | reuse SOF/IHDR/LSD/DIB parsers; ffmpeg -i (I) | high -- \"previews\" |\n| 111 | Geometry synthesis: originals vs crops, aspect-ratio groups, dimension/area order, impossible-device odd one | gap (video-geometry-synthesis) | synthesis text \"original\", \"crop\", \"aspect\", \"device\"; `Files: [...]` of mp4/mov/jpg/png | lib.meta.synthesis + #107-#110 | med-high |\n| 112 | Video color/timing: color_range/space/transfer/primaries (`colr`, VUI), field_order, has_b_frames, avg vs r_frame_rate (VFR screen recordings), start_time/elst, per-stream duration/bit_rate | gap (video-color-timing) | `colr nclx`, `ctts`, irregular `stts` | struct; ffmpeg -i (I) | med |\"\"\"\nrep(tail_tbl, new_rows)\ns+='\\n'\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\ngrep -n '^## \\|^```' reference/coverage/metadata-forensics.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":108642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":882},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"12ea224e-c03c-442e-a972-e0c7035f8c2a","uuid":"16fd7515-29f7-425d-b887-91e017c98edc","timestamp":"2026-10-18T13:06:46.028Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9kZqbWgtcHTuFxbPHGS","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019946ewPvAHT9FYdoZX44p3":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'E'